    "hypothesis": "Reordering matrix multiplication so the innermost loop walks contiguous columns exposes independent output elements for GCC's ARM64 SIMD vectorizer. Reducing modulo after blocks of 16 k-terms keeps the unsigned accumulators within range while avoiding a modulo in the vectorized loop.",
